Team CodeGraph

This repository and its bundled distributions are a substantially modified
derivative of CodeGraph, originally developed by Colby Mchenry and other
contributors at https://github.com/evespimrose/codegraph.

The upstream CodeGraph source is licensed under the MIT License. The original
copyright and permission notice are retained in LICENSE.

Team CodeGraph has been redesigned as a private, CLI-only distribution with
expanded source and document indexing, local semantic inference, provenance,
community analysis, graph reports, and graph visualization. It is distributed
through the team harness rather than the upstream npm, plugin, MCP, or GitHub
release channels.

Third-party dependencies and bundled model assets remain subject to their own
licenses and notices.
